  "text": "## Estimated Timeline\n\nTypical development timelines depend on project scope and system complexity:\n\n- **Corporate / Business Web Application**: 3 to 5 weeks from discovery to deployment.\n- **Advanced Dynamic Web Portal / CMS Platform**: 6 to 9 weeks from discovery to deployment.\n- **Custom E-Commerce / Interactive Web System**: 8 to 12 weeks from discovery to deployment.\n\n---",
